  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#37] [Refactor] ConnectionSubscriptionPushingMessage.Format() uses ConcurrentStringBuilder in single-threaded context — replace with StringBuilder   1. ConcurrentStringBuilder encryptingMessage = new() → StringBuilder encryptingMessage = new() — removes the synchronization overhead on every Append call   2. encryptingMessage.Clone() → new StringBuilder(encryptingMessage.Length).Append(encryptingMessage) — StringBuilder.Append(StringBuilder) copies content without an intermediate string allocation   3. int Values(ConcurrentStringBuilder stringBuilder, ...) → int Values(StringBuilder stringBuilder, ...) — parameter type follows the field   4. Dropped the now-unused using ThunderPropagator.BuildingBlocks.Application; (it was only needed for ConcurrentStringBuilder)",
